        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O herege usa um espelho encantado para revelar verdades ocultas aos fiéis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last breath of the day carries a strange weight. Now, it’s time to decide what will endure." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The last breath of the day carries a strange weight. Now, it’s time to decide what will endure."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O último suspiro do dia traz um peso estranho. Agora, é hora de decidir o que vai perdurar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last light of the day fades — and with it, the silence that precedes the verdict." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The last light of the day fades — and with it, the silence that precedes the verdict."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A última luz do dia se apaga — e com ela, o silêncio que antecede o veredito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The light of the new day dawns on the village - but not everyone should have woken up." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The light of the new day dawns on the village - but not everyone should have woken up."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A luz do novo dia desperta na vila — mas nem todos deveriam ter despertado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mist subsides in the morning - but there are eyes in the forest that have never stopped watching." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The mist subsides in the morning - but there are eyes in the forest that have never stopped watching."
