    },
    "The new sun rises - and the eyes of the cult seek the face of the traitor." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The new sun rises - and the eyes of the cult seek the face of the traitor."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O novo sol se ergue — e os olhos do culto buscam o rosto do traidor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The night has closed like an ancient book — but no day ends without leaving marks on the pages of tomorrow." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The night has closed like an ancient book — but no day ends without leaving marks on the pages of tomorrow."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A noite se fechou como um livro antigo — mas nenhum dia termina sem deixar marcas nas páginas do amanhã."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The night rose heavy — as if bearing the weight of a newborn secret." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The night rose heavy — as if bearing the weight of a newborn secret."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A noite se ergueu pesada — como se carregasse o peso de um segredo recém-nascido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shadow advances over the village — and with it, the moment to point, to judge… and to lose." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The shadow advances over the village — and with it, the moment to point, to judge… and to lose."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A sombra avança sobre a vila — e com ela, o momento de apontar, julgar... e perder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shadow has fallen like a sacred veil. What has been done can no longer be undone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The shadow has fallen like a sacred veil. What has been done can no longer be undone."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A sombra desceu como um véu sagrado. O que foi feito, já não pode ser desfeito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sky darkens, but eyes turn against one another." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sky darkens, but eyes turn against one another."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O céu escurece, mas os olhos se voltam uns contra os outros."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sky is covered in gray — it is the time for heavy words and sealed fates." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sky is covered in gray — it is the time for heavy words and sealed fates."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O céu se cobre de cinza — é a hora das palavras pesadas e dos destinos selados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The spread" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The spread"
