        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Disseminar Rumores"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sun breaks through the horizon - and with it, the eyes of the occult once again turn to the village." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sun breaks through the horizon - and with it, the eyes of the occult once again turn to the village."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O sol rasga o horizonte — e com ele, os olhos do oculto se voltam mais uma vez à vila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sun rises over the village - the cycle begins again, and sacrifice may lie ahead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sun rises over the village - the cycle begins again, and sacrifice may lie ahead."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O sol nasce sobre a vila — o ciclo recomeça, e o sacrifício pode está por vir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sun slowly drowns on the horizon — and with it, poorly buried secrets begin to breathe." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sun slowly drowns on the horizon — and with it, poorly buried secrets begin to breathe."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O sol se afoga lentamente no horizonte — e com ele, segredos mal enterrados começam a respirar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The village awakens under the gaze of the cult - and there is a traitor among those who pray." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The village awakens under the gaze of the cult - and there is a traitor among those who pray."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A vila desperta sob o olhar do culto — e há um traidor entre aqueles que oram."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are suspicious looks and the cult writhes under the weight of suspicion." : {
